				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7eba43dc elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="7eba43dc" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-12873474" data-id="12873474" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3ec7fd98 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="3ec7fd98" data-element_type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4841ab33" data-id="4841ab33" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33413f6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="33413f6" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<style>/*! elementor - v3.14.0 - 26-06-2023 */
.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}</style>				<h4>AUDD is AUSTRALIA&#8217;S REGULATED Australian Digital Dollar STABLECOIN.</h4><p>Issued by AUDC Pty Ltd under an Australian Financial Services Licence (AFSL), AUDD is a fully reserved, 1:1 AUD-backed stablecoin designed for payments, settlement, and cross-border use cases across institutional, retail, and regulated markets.</p><p>AUDD stablecoin is an Australian digital dollar that meets the speed, efficiency, transparency, and demands of the growing shift into the digital world. Available on multiple blockchains, including the Ethereum blockchain as an ERC-20 token, natively on Stellar, XRP Ledger, Solana, Hedera,<span style="font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight );"> XDC Network,</span><span style="font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight );"> BASE and Redbelly Network.</span></p><h4> </h4><h4>A digital asset backed by a real-world asset. The A$.</h4><p>AUDD is collateralised on a 1:1 basis by Australia’s sovereign currency by way of cash in bank accounts or cash equivalents. For every AUDD that it mints, AUDC holds one A$ in reserve.</p><h4>Maximum stability. Pegged to A$.</h4><p>The price of AUDD is pegged to the Australian dollar. This addresses the price volatility that non-stablecoin digital assets experience when their prices swing due to imbalances between the supply and demand of the token.</p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6a36c4cf" data-id="6a36c4cf" data-element_type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-26cb1fae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="26cb1fae" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<h4>Maximum flexibility. Blockchain-agnostic.</h4><p>AUDD is blockchain agnostic, and is available on Stellar, XRP Ledger, Ethereum (ERC-20), Solana, Hedera XDC Network and BASE. Our intention is to add AUDD to more blockchains on a case-by-case basis to meet the use case demand.</p><p><a href="https://stellar.expert/explorer/public/asset/AUDD-GDC7X2MXTYSAKUUGAIQ7J7RPEIM7GXSAIWFYWWH4GLNFECQVJJLB2EEU" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-1450 size-full alignnone" style="margin: 0 30px 30px 0;" src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Vector.png" alt="Stellar" width="116" height="30" /></a><a href="https://sologenic.org/market-index/4155444400000000000000000000000000000000+rUN5Zxt3K1AnMRJgEWywDJT8QDMMeLH5ok"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-1448 size-full alignnone" style="margin: 0 30px 30px 0;" src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Logo-XRP-Full.png" alt="XRP Ledger" width="134" height="34" /></a><a href="https://etherscan.io/token/0x4cce605ed955295432958d8951d0b176c10720d5"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-1441 alignnone" style="margin: 0 30px 30px 0;" src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Logo-Etherium-Full.png" alt="Ethereum" width="127" height="33" /></a><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-2350 alignnone" src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Solana_idN473ehUb_2-300x56.png" alt="" width="136" height="25" srcset="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Solana_idN473ehUb_2-300x56.png 300w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Solana_idN473ehUb_2-768x143.png 768w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Solana_idN473ehUb_2.png 800w" sizes="(max-width: 136px) 100vw, 136px" />      <img decoding="async" class="wp-image-2419 alignnone" src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Hedera-removebg-preview-300x169.png" alt="" width="96" height="54" srcset="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Hedera-removebg-preview-300x169.png 300w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Hedera-removebg-preview.png 666w" sizes="(max-width: 96px) 100vw, 96px" />     <img decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-2777 " src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-300x106.png" alt="" width="145" height="51" srcset="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-300x106.png 300w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-1024x362.png 1024w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-768x271.png 768w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-1536x542.png 1536w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-2048x723.png 2048w, https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/xdc-network-monotone-black-logo-1568x554.png 1568w" sizes="(max-width: 145px) 100vw, 145px" />     <img decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-2680" src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/base_logo-removebg-preview-300x76.png" alt="" width="119" height="30" />     <img decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-2785 " src="https://www.audd.digital/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Redbelly-Network-1.png" alt="" width="235" height="68" /></p><h4>Transparent. LAUNCHED by AUDC.</h4><p>AUDD is issued by AUDC Pty Ltd, an Australian financial services licensee, operating under an Australian Financial Services Licence (AFSL).</p><p>As a licensed issuer, AUDC operates with strong governance, segregated reserves, ongoing compliance obligations, and independent third-party attestations to support transparency, trust, and regulatory alignment. </p><p>AUDC has engaged with a multinational professional services firm to undertake third-party security assessments of its technology platform and public-facing websites.</p>						</div>
				</div>
