				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How can I start using AUDD today?</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2a0dcdc4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2a0dcdc4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Get AUDD today via the AUDD Digital platform</h4>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-349d3060 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="349d3060" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3800000000000001; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: #ffffff;"><a style="color: #ffffff;" href="https://audddigital.tawk.help/article/how-do-i-register-for-an-audd-digital-account"><u>Get started</u></a></span> in just three simple steps:</p><p>Step 1: Sign up on the <span style="color: #ffffff;"><a style="color: #ffffff;" href="https://get.audd.digital/"><u>AUDD Digital platform</u></a></span><br />Step 2: Purchase AUDD<br />Step 3: Buy, swap and sell AUDD on Ethereum, Stellar, XRPL, Hedera, XDC, BASE or  Redbelly – via the AUDD Digital platform</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23acce5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="23acce5" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
			<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://get.audd.digital/" target="_blank">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
						<span class="elementor-button-text">Register Now!</span>
		</span>
					</a>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d250aae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d250aae" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p><span style="color: #ffffff;">For more information on how to register, <a style="color: #ffffff;" href="https://audddigital.tawk.help/article/how-do-i-register-for-an-audd-digital-account"><u>click here.</u></a></span></p><p>AUDD is issued by AUDC Pty Ltd, an Australian Financial Services Licensee.<br />Access to AUDD is provided in accordance with applicable regulatory requirements, including onboarding, verification, and compliance obligations where relevant.</p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
