							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1111" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="1" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1111" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Is AUDD a cryptocurrency?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1111" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1111"><p>AUDD is the premier Australian Dollar (A$) backed stablecoin, which is a type of digital currency. This is reviewed and attested regularly by our external auditors. See our <a href="https://www.audd.digital/transparency/">Transparency</a> Page for more.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1112" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="2" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1112" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How to Buy AUDD using Australian Dollars</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1112" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1112"><p><u><a href="https://audddigital.tawk.help/article/how-to-buy-audd-using-australian-dollars">This guide is designed to walk you through the process of purchasing AUDD in a simple and understandable manner. View here.</a></u></p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1113" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="3" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1113" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">What does it mean for AUDD to be 'minted' or 'burned'?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1113" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1113"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">AUDD is only minted and distributed upon confirmation of the equivalent A$ being received/present in the custodial bank account, AUD</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">C</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Pty Ltd. For security and best practice, AUDD is not pre-minted, or minted based on credit. </span></p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1114" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="4" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1114" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How many blockchains will AUDD be deployed on?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1114" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1114"><p>AUDD is a multichain solution, meaning it is available on more than one blockchain. AUDD is currently natively deployed on Ethereum, Stellar, XRP Ledger, Solana, Base, Hedera, XDC and Redbelly. It will be deployed across more blockchains on a case-by-case basis.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1115" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="5" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1115" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">What is meant by 'blockchain agnostic'? Why is this important?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1115" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="5" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1115"><p>AUDD is issued on multiple blockchains. Taking a ‘blockchain agnostic’ approach, we do not limit AUDD to one market or use case – much like you would not limit other payments to bank transfers or credit card payments.</p><p>AUDD functions over multiple blockchain technologies already on Stellar, XRP Ledger, Ethereum, Solana and Hedera. We intend to add AUDD to more blockchains on a case-by-case basis.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1116" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="6" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1116" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How much AUDD is in circulation?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1116" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="6" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1116"><p>AUDD’s real currency backing is fully transparent. Visit our <a href="https://www.audd.digital/transparency/">Transparency</a> page on our website that shows the regular attestation results where transaction data on the blockchain is reconciled with the actual A$ fiat currency holdings.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1117" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="7" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1117" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How is AUDD Regulated in Australia?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1117" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="7" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1117"><p>AUDD is issued by AUDC Pty Ltd under an Australian Financial Services Licence.<br />This means AUDC is subject to Australian financial services laws, including obligations relating to governance, compliance, risk management, disclosure, and oversight by ASIC.</p></div>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-33f9dc40" data-id="33f9dc40" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5af62e87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5af62e87" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Stability and Security</h4>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23d0a7c2 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion" data-id="23d0a7c2" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="accordion.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-accordion">
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6001" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="1" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6001" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How can I trust that AUDD will always be equivalent to an Australian dollar?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-6001" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-6001"><p>AUDD is 1:1 backed by Australian Dollars or cash equivalents held by a Bare Trust by the issuer, AUDC PTY LTD.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6002" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="2" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6002" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How is AUDD different from a CBDC (central bank digital currency)?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-6002" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-6002"><p>Some key differences are that:</p><ol><li>CBDC is issued by a central bank, whereas stablecoins such as AUDD are issued by financial services institutions</li><li>In a technology sense AUDD is validated through a public blockchain, whilst CBDCs will usually operate on private blockchains.</li><li>CBDCs aim to maintain monetary control, while stablecoins serve multiple purposes, including digital payments and use in the digitally native ecosystem.</li></ol><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">eAUD (Australia&#8217;s proposed CBDC) for example, will be centralised in nature, due to the restrictions or permissions placed upon it by the blockchain upon which it operates. The industry does not anticipate the release of eAUD for at least another five years and the current expectation is that it will be a wholesale token, not a retail product.</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In contrast, we see that industry stablecoins, such as AUDD, will focus on solving business use cases and driving the digital transformation of payments. </span></p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6003" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="3" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6003" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Where is the AUDD collateral held?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-6003" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-6003"><p>AUDD is 1:1 backed by Australian Dollars, through cash or cash equivalents, held in Australian Financial Institution accounts by the issuer, AUDC PTY LTD.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6004" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="4" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6004" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How is AUDD stored?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-6004" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-6004"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As AUDD is minted on an &#8216;as needed&#8217; basis, the storage of AUDD by AUD</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">C</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Pty Ltd for prolonged periods of time will not be required. The receiving entity purchasing the stablecoin (taking ownership of AUDD) is responsible for the custody of the AUDD they acquire.</span></p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-6005" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="5" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-6005" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none"><path d="M13 8.15653V5.27653H8.39199V0.644531H5.51199V5.27653H0.903992V8.15653H5.51199V12.7885H8.39199V8.15653H13Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="4" viewBox="0 0 7 4" fill="none"><path d="M6.83692 3.12448V0.29248H0.164917V3.12448H6.83692Z" fill="#4600FF"></path></svg></span>
