				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">AUDC Pty Ltd (ACN 637 164 722) is the issuer of AUDD stablecoin – the Australian Digital Dollar. <br>It holds an Australian Financial Services Licence (AFSL No. 700123) authorising it to issue and deal in non-cash payment products, including AUDD, to retail and wholesale clients. <br>AUDD is issued in accordance with applicable Australian financial services laws and regulatory obligations. <br>© 2026 AUDC Pty Ltd. All rights reserved.</p>		</div>
